  "display_title": "You Get Me Going",
  "description": "Despite being thirty-three, Young-won sure is gullible. He falls in love way too easily, comes on way too hard, and still believes that he’ll meet “Mr. Right” sooner or later. Not that he knows who “Mr. Right” is, but he sure does know about “Mr. Wrong,” a.k.a. Kang Hyun-woo. Young-won swears that he’ll never, ever get together with this polar opposite of his, but the universe sure seems to think different. One drunken night, they end up in the same bed and Hyun-woo proposes an intriguing deal… Will Young-won end up with a broken heart yet again, or will he end up finding what he’s been looking for this whole time? \n\n(Source: Lezhin US) \n\n*Note: Includes three extra chapters.*",
